  "body": "### Summary\nAs a reader, I want the \"page enregistrée hors ligne\" banner to read clearly over the messages, so that the confirmation is not lost in the page text.\n\n### Found by\nMac check of LOT-186 (#552) on dev-swift dc38ffb9, iPhone 18 Pro simulator (iOS 27.0), light mode, logged out, public topic.\n\n### Steps\n1. Open a topic, scroll down a little.\n2. Top bar, overflow \"Plus\", \"Enregistrer cette page hors ligne\".\n\n### Expected\nThe banner (OfflineSaveBanner, a LOT-185 safeAreaBar) has a glass or fill background like the other chrome.\n\n### Actual\n\"1 page enregistrée hors ligne\" and its close button are bare text under the navigation bar with no fill: the first lines of the message underneath ghost through. Readable, but it is the \"bare text over the page\" case that the follow-up note on #552 asked to turn into glass. The page does not move when it appears (0 pt shift).\n\n### Suggested direction (not a fix)\nglassEffect(.regular, in: .capsule) or a bar-like background, as the toast has.\n\nRefs #545\n",
